(B) SYMMETRIC LLL:   e * p * (D+1) <= 1  ?
================================================================================
   lopsided D=8:  e*p*(D+1) = 3.4949  > 1  FAILS
   full DF=10:  e*p*(D+1) = 4.2716  > 1  FAILS
   symmetric LLL needs D+1 <= 1/(e*p) = 7/e = 2.5752, i.e. D <= 1.5752
   => symmetric LLL needs max degree D <= 1 (each event depends on <=1 other).

